    Whoever runs a Holdall, on a computer or a server, is responsible for it and for the data in it. The Holdall project has no access to your Holdall and cannot recover
    lost data. Keep backups.
  </p>

  <h2>The sign-in relay and the demo</h2>
  <p>
    The sign-in relay at auth.holdall.site and the demo at demo.holdall.site are free services offered on a best effort basis. They can be slow, unavailable, changed or
    stopped at any time. If the relay stops, a Holdall admin can still connect Google and Outlook with their own apps, see the
